<view class="page-shell beta-page" style="padding-top:{{statusBarHeight}}px;"><image class="page-texture" src="/assets/ui/material-texture.jpg" mode="aspectFill" /><view class="beta-topbar content-layer"><text class="brand-script beta-brand">Note4Seven</text><view class="beta-heading"><view class="beta-back" bindtap="goBack"><image src="/assets/ui/icons/chevron-left.svg" /></view><text class="beta-heading-title">隐私与数据</text><view></view></view></view><scroll-view class="beta-scroll content-layer" scroll-y enhanced show-scrollbar="{{false}}"><view class="beta-body privacy-body"><view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="beta-loading">正在加载...</view><block wx:elif="{{view}}"><view class="privacy-card beta-glass"><image src="/assets/ui/icons/shield.svg" /><text class="privacy-title">隐私与数据说明 {{view.version}}</text><text>更新日期：{{view.updatedDate}}</text><text>照片仅用于生成贴纸、日期详情和有权限的图片合集。模块成员之外的用户无法浏览记录；退出成员的历史身份会匿名展示。</text><text>照片存储在私有空间中，仅通过短期访问地址展示。服务端会校验模块成员身份和操作权限，并按隐私说明处理数据。</text></view><view wx:if="{{view.deletionRequest && view.deletionRequest.status === 'cooling_off'}}" class="deletion-state beta-glass"><text>账号删除冷静期中</text><text>预计处理时间：{{view.deletionRequest.executeAfter}}</text><button class="beta-secondary" bindtap="cancelDeletion">撤销删除申请</button></view><button wx:else class="delete-account" bindtap="requestDeletion">申请删除账号</button></block></view></scroll-view></view>
<privacy-dialog />
